{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3020008030010","name":"透","text":"────おっ……","trans":"————哦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030030","name":"透","text":"入ってるわ、チョコレート","trans":"塞着呢，巧克力","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030040","name":"円香","text":"なんで靴箱に入れるのか、本当に謎","trans":"为什么要放进鞋柜，真是个谜","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030060","name":"円香","text":"……メッセージカード。落ちた","trans":"……信息卡。掉了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030070","name":"透","text":"あー\r\nサンキュー","trans":"啊——\n谢了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030080","name":"透","text":"よっ……","trans":"哟……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030090","name":"透","text":"……『浅倉先輩へ　１年３組────』","trans":"……“致浅仓前辈　1年3班————”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030100","name":"円香","text":"……先行ってる","trans":"……我先走了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-39","name":"一年生１","text":"浅倉先輩！　あの……っ","trans":"浅仓前辈！　那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-42","name":"一年生１","text":"あのっ\r\nこれをもらってほしくって……","trans":"那个\n希望你能收下这个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030150","name":"透","text":"ふふ、オッケー\r\nありがと","trans":"呵呵，好\n谢谢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-47","name":"歓声","text":"キャー！","trans":"呀啊——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-50","name":"一年生１","text":"あのっ、あの……\r\n友達もいいですか……？","trans":"那个、那个……\n我朋友也可以吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030170","name":"透","text":"ウェルカム","trans":"欢迎","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-56","name":"一年生１","text":"あのっ、あの……あの……\r\nもうひとつお願い、いいですか……？","trans":"那个、那个……那个……\n还有一个请求，可以吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-61","name":"一年生１","text":"そしたら、\r\nあいちんって呼んでもらっていいですか？","trans":"那样的话，\n可以叫我“爱亲”吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030190","name":"透","text":"え？","trans":"诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-63","name":"一年生１","text":"あいちんって、呼んでもらっていいですか？","trans":"可以叫我“爱亲”吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030200","name":"透","text":"え、誰？","trans":"诶，谁？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-65","name":"一年生１","text":"あのっ、私なんですけど\r\nあいちんって……","trans":"那个，是我啦\n“爱亲”就是……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030220","name":"透","text":"あいちん","trans":"爱亲","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-72","name":"一年生２","text":"あの、わたしもいいですか！","trans":"那个，我也可以吗！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030230","name":"透","text":"え、呼ぶの？","trans":"诶，也要叫吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-74","name":"一年生２","text":"まいちんでお願いします","trans":"请叫我“舞亲”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030240","name":"透","text":"まいちん？","trans":"舞亲？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-80","name":"一年生２","text":"────！\r\nもう一回いいですか！","trans":"————！\n能再来一次吗！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030250","name":"透","text":"まいちん","trans":"舞亲","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030270","name":"透","text":"ありがと、あいちん\r\nまいちん","trans":"谢谢，爱亲\n舞亲","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-88","name":"一年生たち","text":"キャー…………！","trans":"呀——…………！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030280","name":"透","text":"じゃ、これ\r\n記入お願いします","trans":"那，这个\n请填写一下","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-106","name":"クラスメイト１","text":"────すごいねぇ、浅倉さん","trans":"————真厉害啊，浅仓","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-108","name":"クラスメイト１","text":"名簿で管理してるんだ？\r\nチョコレート","trans":"用名册来管理吗？\n巧克力","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030310","name":"透","text":"あー……\r\nうん、やれって","trans":"啊——……\n嗯，被要求这么做","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030320","name":"透","text":"友達が","trans":"朋友说的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030330","name":"透","text":"大変だったから、１年とき\r\n覚えられなくて","trans":"因为太麻烦了，一年级的时候\n实在记不住","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-116","name":"クラスメイト１","text":"ええー、お返しが？","trans":"诶——，回礼？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030340","name":"透","text":"うん","trans":"嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-120","name":"クラスメイト２","text":"浅倉っちー\r\nパス！！　チョコ！！！","trans":"浅仓亲——\n传过来！！　巧克力！！！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030370","name":"透","text":"あっ、待った\r\n書いてー、これー……！","trans":"啊，等等\n写一下——，这个——……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-128","name":"クラスメイト２","text":"後でー！","trans":"待会儿——！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-133","name":"クラスメイト１","text":"……律儀だねー","trans":"……真认真啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030380","name":"透","text":"ふふっ\r\nそうですよ","trans":"呵呵\n是啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-142","name":"クラスメイト１","text":"僕もいいですか","trans":"我也可以吗","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030410","name":"透","text":"ふふっ\r\nじゃ","trans":"呵呵\n那","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030420","name":"透","text":"書いて、名前","trans":"写下，名字","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030430","name":"小糸","text":"け、結構もらったんだね……！","trans":"收、收到挺多的呢……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030450","name":"小糸","text":"名簿、便利そう……？","trans":"名册，好像很方便……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030470","name":"小糸","text":"靴箱と机に入ってたのも、\r\n書き写さないとだね……","trans":"鞋柜和桌子里的那些，\n也得抄下来才行呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030480","name":"透","text":"んー\r\nやるやる","trans":"嗯——\n会做的会做的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030490","name":"雛菜","text":"雛菜も名前書く～！","trans":"雏菜也要写名字～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030500","name":"透","text":"オッケー\r\nサンクス","trans":"好\n谢谢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030510","name":"雛菜","text":"雛菜４つ入ってるのあげたから\r\n４つ書いていい～？","trans":"雏菜给了装了4个的\n可以写4个吗～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030530","name":"小糸","text":"あ、じゃあ\r\nわたしも書こうかな……！","trans":"啊，那\n我也写一个吧……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030540","name":"透","text":"書いて、いっぱい","trans":"写吧，多写点","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030570","name":"小糸","text":"ま、円香ちゃんは、発案者だし……","trans":"圆、圆香是提案人嘛……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030580","name":"円香","text":"ていうか、渡してない","trans":"话说，我还没给呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030590","name":"透","text":"くれるじゃん、でも","trans":"那你还不是会给我嘛","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030620","name":"透","text":"ちゃんと、一網打尽にしないとだから","trans":"得好好一网打尽才行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3020008030630","name":"透","text":"名簿で","trans":"用名册","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}